title: "Entropy Jumps and Information Relaxation in Financial Markets"
abstract: >-
  Maximum entropy in volume time, a three-channel decomposition of return
  entropy (scale, dependence, shape), a jump/diffusion account of how
  information moves it, and a stress-testing construction calibrated in nats.
